1
00:00:10,344 --> 00:00:12,179
Hey, can you speak?

2
00:00:14,431 --> 00:00:15,265
Guess not.

3
00:00:16,225 --> 00:00:17,893
Please wake up!

4
00:00:18,268 --> 00:00:23,106
You're a good guy!
Don't become a bad guy!

5
00:00:33,242 --> 00:00:34,701
What is this creature?!

6
00:00:37,996 --> 00:00:39,998
Thank you for stopping me.

7
00:00:40,791 --> 00:00:43,335
Hold on...
Are you back to normal?

8
00:00:44,336 --> 00:00:46,296
Seems like it.

9
00:00:46,421 --> 00:00:47,839
Yay! Yay!

10
00:00:47,965 --> 00:00:49,633
He's back!

11
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:53,387
Are you saying that creature
was controlling you?

12
00:00:53,762 --> 00:00:56,390
I really want to tell you
everything,

13
00:00:56,974 --> 00:01:00,686
but first, could you please untie me?

14
00:01:01,019 --> 00:01:02,980
It's so uncomfortable,
I can't stand it.

15
00:01:03,146 --> 00:01:04,481
What do you think, Keiji?

16
00:01:04,606 --> 00:01:07,025
If he starts rampaging,
I'll take care of him.

17
00:01:09,820 --> 00:01:12,281
I'm finally free!

18
00:01:14,866 --> 00:01:15,701
Oh?

19
00:01:16,201 --> 00:01:17,619
My arms fell off...

20
00:01:18,161 --> 00:01:20,539
That's so gross!

21
00:01:21,039 --> 00:01:24,918
Well, I didn't expect to
be saved by chickens...

22
00:01:25,294 --> 00:01:26,962
Thank you so much.

23
00:01:27,379 --> 00:01:29,756
Oh, you're the one
from the other day...

24
00:01:30,424 --> 00:01:31,550
You remember me?

25
00:01:31,758 --> 00:01:32,718
Yeah.

26
00:01:32,884 --> 00:01:37,598
My body may have been possessed,
but my mind and heart were intact.

27
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:42,311
Even though I was being controlled,
I am deeply sorry.

28
00:01:42,477 --> 00:01:44,646
So the Devils were
behind all of this.

29
00:01:45,981 --> 00:01:48,400
Yeah, it was back then...

30
00:01:56,074 --> 00:01:59,619
When that creature lodged itself
in my brain,

31
00:01:59,786 --> 00:02:04,833
I immediately sprouted arms.
And I lost all control of my body.

32
00:02:08,420 --> 00:02:09,963
I shudder, thinking

33
00:02:10,088 --> 00:02:12,716
I was parasitized by
this disgusting creature!

34
00:02:12,841 --> 00:02:15,802
You're kinda disgusting yourself,
Old Man Octopus!

35
00:02:16,053 --> 00:02:19,473
My, you've got no shame,
Little Chick!

36
00:02:19,556 --> 00:02:22,184
To think the Devils had
such an ability.

37
00:02:22,476 --> 00:02:24,811
They're on another level
from the Demons.

38
00:02:24,978 --> 00:02:28,774
So that's how they collected all
the Demons in the abandoned factory...

39
00:02:28,982 --> 00:02:31,610
By the way, have you seen
this Demon before?

40
00:02:31,818 --> 00:02:35,489
Ah, it's one of the ones
they brought in recently.

41
00:02:35,697 --> 00:02:37,199
He was in the warehouse.

42
00:02:37,824 --> 00:02:39,660
What are the Devils planning?

43
00:02:39,785 --> 00:02:43,121
Do they want to destroy all the cities
and make humans suffer?

44
00:02:43,330 --> 00:02:45,832
Nope. That was just to
let off some steam.

45
00:02:45,874 --> 00:02:46,792
Let off some steam?

46
00:02:47,542 --> 00:02:50,253
If we don't let off some steam
here and there,

47
00:02:50,379 --> 00:02:51,713
we end up rampaging.

48
00:02:51,838 --> 00:02:55,550
I suspect we were under a lot of
stress.

49
00:02:55,676 --> 00:02:57,844
So, what are their true motives?

50
00:02:58,428 --> 00:02:59,846
That... I don't know.

51
00:02:59,971 --> 00:03:02,724
But I did overhear them once...

52
00:03:03,767 --> 00:03:06,269
<i>Damn it, no leads again.</i>

53
00:03:06,603 --> 00:03:10,065
<i>Don't sweat it, Yuji.
Let's take our time searching.</i>

54
00:03:10,482 --> 00:03:11,608
Search?

55
00:03:11,983 --> 00:03:13,151
Search for what?

56
00:03:13,276 --> 00:03:15,070
That's not important.

57
00:03:15,445 --> 00:03:17,030
Take me to the abandoned factory.

58
00:03:17,364 --> 00:03:18,657
I'm going to save Morio.

59
00:03:18,782 --> 00:03:20,242
B-But how?

60
00:03:20,492 --> 00:03:23,036
Old Man Octopus came
to his senses...

61
00:03:23,161 --> 00:03:25,038
...so there's got to be a way.

62
00:03:25,163 --> 00:03:26,957
I want to help too!

63
00:03:29,126 --> 00:03:30,709
Do you understand the situation,
Piyoko?!

64
00:03:30,710 --> 00:03:32,879
There's a horde of Demons
laying in wait!

65
00:03:33,422 --> 00:03:37,342
I know that even if I go,
I won't be much help.

66
00:03:38,009 --> 00:03:40,429
But I want to help save Morio!

67
00:03:40,554 --> 00:03:43,890
I want to help your friend, Mister!

68
00:03:44,433 --> 00:03:45,350
Piyoko...

69
00:03:45,809 --> 00:03:47,561
I-I understand
how everyone feels, but...

70
00:03:47,602 --> 00:03:49,229
The Devils are dangerously strong.

71
00:03:49,563 --> 00:03:52,774
We should come up with a strategy
and proceed with caution.

72
00:03:52,858 --> 00:03:53,984
I knew it...

73
00:03:55,110 --> 00:03:57,362
You're scared of them.

74
00:03:57,612 --> 00:04:01,241
B-Brother, you haven't seen them
in real life.

75
00:04:01,366 --> 00:04:03,702
I've fought them firsthand!

76
00:04:04,327 --> 00:04:06,454
You couldn't even beat me...
How can you even think—

77
00:04:06,455 --> 00:04:08,748
- you can win?
- It doesn't matter who wins.

78
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:11,168
I'm gonna save Morio.

79
00:04:11,501 --> 00:04:12,836
That's all there is to it.

80
00:04:15,630 --> 00:04:18,550
<i>I hate to admit it, but...
Big Brother is totally right.</i>

81
00:04:19,009 --> 00:04:21,386
<i>I don't stand a chance,
being scared like this.</i>

82
00:04:21,887 --> 00:04:23,180
<i>I can do this!</i>

83
00:04:23,305 --> 00:04:26,308
<i>I'll save Father!
No matter what!</i>

84
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:27,684
Keiji.

85
00:04:28,435 --> 00:04:31,730
Sorry, I just realized there's someone
I have to meet up with.

86
00:04:32,189 --> 00:04:34,691
I'll meet up with you
as soon as I'm done.

87
00:04:35,650 --> 00:04:36,568
Got it.

88
00:04:43,658 --> 00:04:45,660
Hold on, Morio!

89
00:06:36,897 --> 00:06:38,690
PAPA!

90
00:06:38,899 --> 00:06:40,399
ELIZABETH!

91
00:06:40,400 --> 00:06:41,693
PAPA!

92
00:06:41,776 --> 00:06:45,154
I'VE MISSED YOU, ELIZABETH!

93
00:06:45,155 --> 00:06:47,824
P-PAPA I CAN'T BREATHE!

94
00:06:47,908 --> 00:06:50,659
I'M SORRY.
IT'S BEEN SIX MONTHS!

95
00:06:50,660 --> 00:06:52,037
<i>He's amazing.</i>

96
00:06:52,078 --> 00:06:54,456
<i>His mastery of Chickenese
continues to progress!</i>

97
00:06:54,956 --> 00:06:56,875
Papa, did you bring
what I requested?

98
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,543
Yes, it's all ready.

99
00:06:58,627 --> 00:06:59,461
Bring it.

100
00:07:00,045 --> 00:07:02,631
Here you are, Miss Elizabeth.

101
00:07:04,758 --> 00:07:07,218
Amazing! All this,
completed in only 4 hours?!

102
00:07:07,886 --> 00:07:10,804
I had my Yonezaka Group get
to work on it right away.

103
00:07:10,805 --> 00:07:12,223
We're very proud of the results.

104
00:07:12,557 --> 00:07:14,142
We did everything that we could

105
00:07:14,184 --> 00:07:16,186
to add in all of the functions
that you requested.

106
00:07:16,227 --> 00:07:17,520
Thank you, Papa!

107
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:19,606
It was nothing, Elizabeth.

108
00:07:19,898 --> 00:07:22,400
But... why do you need
something like this?

109
00:07:24,778 --> 00:07:27,947
I met a Demon
who changed my worldview.

110
00:07:28,865 --> 00:07:32,577
I realized that only killing Demons
isn't the only way to solve problems.

111
00:07:33,244 --> 00:07:37,290
I see.
You truly are a kind child.

112
00:07:38,041 --> 00:07:40,168
I love you, Elizabeth.

113
00:07:40,377 --> 00:07:42,170
I love you too, Papa.

114
00:07:50,929 --> 00:07:53,640
EPISODE 9:
GONE TO THE BIRDS

115
00:07:57,894 --> 00:07:59,062
We've been expecting you.

116
00:08:02,399 --> 00:08:04,234
Is that little chick part
of your gang too?

117
00:08:05,402 --> 00:08:06,653
Seems tough.

118
00:08:08,738 --> 00:08:10,198
Let my father go!

119
00:08:10,407 --> 00:08:13,201
Father?
Oh, you're his son?

120
00:08:13,535 --> 00:08:14,744
You two look nothing alike—!

121
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:23,837
Huh. Your friend isn't half bad.

122
00:08:24,003 --> 00:08:25,797
Nice. We've got ourselves
a live one.

123
00:08:25,922 --> 00:08:28,591
Hey scumbag,
what did you do with Morio?

124
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:29,843
Morio?

125
00:08:30,343 --> 00:08:32,887
<i>Oh, must be the Demon Mama captured.</i>

126
00:08:33,221 --> 00:08:35,014
<i>So, this is the one...</i>

127
00:08:36,099 --> 00:08:38,560
<i>Those others that you speak of...</i>

128
00:08:38,768 --> 00:08:41,479
<i>One of them might be
a rooster that I know well.</i>

129
00:08:41,980 --> 00:08:44,023
<i>I knew he would eventually show up.</i>

130
00:08:44,315 --> 00:08:46,901
<i>But I didn't expect them to join up
as a family and come here.</i>

131
00:08:47,318 --> 00:08:49,446
<i>It's a bit earlier that
I would have liked, but...</i>

132
00:08:49,571 --> 00:08:52,323
<i>It might be time to hunt
that one down.</i>

133
00:08:52,991 --> 00:08:54,075
<i>Listen to me, Hikari.</i>

134
00:08:54,200 --> 00:08:56,286
<i>You must not kill that one.</i>

135
00:08:56,494 --> 00:08:58,329
<i>But do as you please with the rest.</i>

136
00:08:58,913 --> 00:09:02,000
<i>But be very careful, understand?</i>

137
00:09:02,250 --> 00:09:03,418
<i>Yes, Mama.</i>

138
00:09:05,962 --> 00:09:10,008
Isn't your goal to
eradicate Demons?

139
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:13,928
Why are you risking your life
for one pathetic Demon?

140
00:09:14,512 --> 00:09:17,599
Pathetic... Demon?

141
00:09:18,558 --> 00:09:23,396
Morio put his life on the line
to save people.

142
00:09:23,855 --> 00:09:26,524
You don't know the first thing
about him.

143
00:09:26,941 --> 00:09:29,694
You forced him to assault
the same humans he fought to protect.

144
00:09:29,736 --> 00:09:34,032
The pain and guilt he felt...
doing the opposite of what he believed in.

145
00:09:34,657 --> 00:09:39,704
It must have been hard for him.
His heart must've been screaming in pain.

146
00:09:40,288 --> 00:09:44,501
- Morio's kind, so it must've been torture.
- Keiji!

147
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:48,671
It's unforgiveable.

148
00:09:49,005 --> 00:09:51,800
You stomped on Morio's heart,

149
00:09:51,925 --> 00:09:53,760
so now,
you're going to pay for it.

150
00:09:54,219 --> 00:09:57,806
You make my crown curl!

151
00:09:59,849 --> 00:10:03,394
Friendship... and familial bonds, huh?

152
00:10:04,771 --> 00:10:07,190
<i>All that's meaningless in the end...</i>

153
00:10:07,774 --> 00:10:08,817
Fine.

154
00:10:08,858 --> 00:10:10,318
We can let them go.

155
00:10:11,569 --> 00:10:12,779
In exchange...

156
00:10:18,243 --> 00:10:20,745
...we're gonna have you play
with some of our friends.

157
00:10:22,080 --> 00:10:23,581
Hold on tight, Piyoko.

158
00:10:23,706 --> 00:10:25,083
G-Got it!

159
00:10:25,416 --> 00:10:27,460
The game starts now!

160
00:10:30,255 --> 00:10:32,257
Don't kill the one with
the red crown.

161
00:10:32,382 --> 00:10:33,758
But you can slaughter the rest.

162
00:10:42,100 --> 00:10:44,894
<i>Damn it, I can't find an opening
to use my Kokekokko.</i>

163
00:10:45,979 --> 00:10:46,813
That's it!

164
00:10:47,188 --> 00:10:50,316
Kokekokko!

165
00:10:50,817 --> 00:10:51,734
Take this!

166
00:10:54,779 --> 00:10:57,115
Totem Ko!

167
00:11:01,119 --> 00:11:04,080
I've got no time to waste.
If I can't defeat the Devils...

168
00:11:05,957 --> 00:11:07,500
...I'll wipe out the rest!

169
00:11:09,085 --> 00:11:10,795
Rapid Wind Strike!

170
00:11:17,427 --> 00:11:18,261
Hatsu!

171
00:11:18,553 --> 00:11:19,429
Triple!

172
00:11:19,554 --> 00:11:20,388
Ten!

173
00:11:20,972 --> 00:11:23,850
Fifth Heavenly Path!

174
00:11:25,852 --> 00:11:27,729
Explosive Dragon Strike!

175
00:11:30,523 --> 00:11:32,275
Not bad, not bad!

176
00:11:32,400 --> 00:11:33,943
Look at them go!

177
00:11:34,277 --> 00:11:37,030
Hey, Hikari...
Can I go out there soon?

178
00:11:37,197 --> 00:11:38,031
Nope.

179
00:11:44,871 --> 00:11:47,624
Damn it. This is annoying...

180
00:11:48,208 --> 00:11:50,335
That's it, I'm killing you all at once!

181
00:11:50,835 --> 00:11:51,920
Don't kill them!

182
00:11:58,968 --> 00:12:00,428
Sorry I'm late.

183
00:12:00,929 --> 00:12:02,096
Elizabeth!

184
00:12:07,060 --> 00:12:08,019
They're not dead...

185
00:12:08,645 --> 00:12:10,855
Did you just do that with
that machine?

186
00:12:10,897 --> 00:12:11,731
Yes.

187
00:12:12,106 --> 00:12:15,902
The DEG, or Digital Energy Gun, Raijin.

188
00:12:15,944 --> 00:12:18,571
Concussions will leave them
paralyzed for the next 2-3 days.

189
00:12:18,655 --> 00:12:20,740
I'm glad this worked immediately.

190
00:12:21,157 --> 00:12:23,451
Among this horde of possessed Demons,

191
00:12:23,576 --> 00:12:27,080
might be another kind Demon like Morio,
or the Octopus Demon.

192
00:12:28,581 --> 00:12:30,541
I want good Demons to survive!

193
00:12:36,506 --> 00:12:38,841
Y-You're so amazing, Miss Elizabeth!

194
00:12:40,009 --> 00:12:41,219
Not bad!

195
00:12:41,302 --> 00:12:43,763
Oh, another one showed up.

196
00:12:45,598 --> 00:12:48,142
Well, why don't we raise
the stakes a little, then?

197
00:12:56,693 --> 00:12:57,735
Morio!

198
00:12:58,653 --> 00:12:59,821
Morio!

199
00:12:59,988 --> 00:13:01,739
Morio! It's me!

200
00:13:01,864 --> 00:13:03,074
Keiji!

201
00:13:08,663 --> 00:13:09,831
Hey, you son of a–!

202
00:13:10,206 --> 00:13:11,833
Snap out of it, man!

203
00:13:17,171 --> 00:13:19,549
So, what are you gonna do now?

204
00:13:26,097 --> 00:13:27,724
I'm going to wake Morio up!

205
00:13:28,433 --> 00:13:29,809
I leave those two big ones to you!

206
00:13:30,059 --> 00:13:30,893
Got it!

207
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:39,736
Kokekokko!

208
00:13:39,986 --> 00:13:41,404
Mister, don't!

209
00:13:41,654 --> 00:13:43,239
Morio will die if you do that!

210
00:13:43,698 --> 00:13:45,658
The parasite should be
inside his head!

211
00:13:45,783 --> 00:13:48,327
If I kill the parasite,
maybe I can set him free!

212
00:13:49,954 --> 00:13:54,876
Kokekokko!

213
00:14:00,548 --> 00:14:02,216
Damn it, it's no use.

214
00:14:04,719 --> 00:14:05,928
Mister...

215
00:14:06,137 --> 00:14:08,222
I will save Morio.

216
00:14:08,765 --> 00:14:09,599
What did you say?

217
00:14:09,682 --> 00:14:13,936
I think I'm small enough to
climb inside of Morio's head.

218
00:14:14,062 --> 00:14:16,647
If I can defeat the monster
inside his body,

219
00:14:16,773 --> 00:14:18,483
Morio will return to his old self.

220
00:14:18,941 --> 00:14:20,276
Are you insane?

221
00:14:20,318 --> 00:14:21,402
You know that's impossible—

222
00:14:21,527 --> 00:14:23,571
We won't know unless we try!

223
00:14:24,030 --> 00:14:28,159
I've been by your side
watching how you fight every fight.

224
00:14:28,326 --> 00:14:30,244
So I can fight!

225
00:14:30,661 --> 00:14:32,371
No, but you...

226
00:14:32,497 --> 00:14:35,625
Yes, I can! It's the only way!

227
00:14:43,716 --> 00:14:45,676
You might die, you know.

228
00:14:46,803 --> 00:14:50,515
I won't die,
until I'm by your side, Mister!

229
00:14:57,396 --> 00:14:58,815
<i>I knew it,
it's not powerful enough.</i>

230
00:15:03,569 --> 00:15:04,529
Oh yeah, then...

231
00:15:05,738 --> 00:15:07,448
...how about this?!

232
00:15:09,826 --> 00:15:12,411
Raijin Shot Full Charge!

233
00:15:18,584 --> 00:15:19,460
All right!

234
00:15:20,169 --> 00:15:22,255
I can use this as my weapon.

235
00:15:22,380 --> 00:15:24,173
You'll need some rope with you too.

236
00:15:25,174 --> 00:15:26,968
I'm ready to go!

237
00:15:29,971 --> 00:15:30,972
Hop on, Piyoko!

238
00:15:31,305 --> 00:15:32,306
R-Roger!

239
00:15:35,935 --> 00:15:37,061
How do we get you inside?!

240
00:15:37,270 --> 00:15:40,815
Um... um...
Maybe through his nose!

241
00:15:50,575 --> 00:15:52,743
Damn it. This is annoying.

242
00:15:53,744 --> 00:15:57,582
Hey, Morio!
Let me get inside your head!

243
00:15:57,665 --> 00:16:01,335
Stand still
so I can save you, dummy!

244
00:16:01,419 --> 00:16:03,587
Piyoko, I think the only way is

245
00:16:03,588 --> 00:16:05,590
to have Elizabeth use her gun
to knock him out.

246
00:16:05,631 --> 00:16:07,967
I see! That could work!

247
00:16:08,176 --> 00:16:10,720
In that case, leave it to me!

248
00:16:19,937 --> 00:16:23,941
I overheard your plan.
You're very brave, little one.

249
00:16:24,150 --> 00:16:25,526
- Old Man Octopus!
- Octopops!

250
00:16:25,610 --> 00:16:27,069
Now, little chick!

251
00:16:27,195 --> 00:16:29,405
Don't worry
I'm stronger than I look.

252
00:16:29,530 --> 00:16:31,407
I'll keep him restrained.

253
00:16:31,532 --> 00:16:33,326
Thank you, Octopops!

254
00:16:53,888 --> 00:16:56,349
Fifth Fist Heavenly Path!

255
00:16:57,433 --> 00:16:59,352
Explosive Chicken Leg!

256
00:17:03,522 --> 00:17:06,150
Hikari... Isn't time?

257
00:17:18,871 --> 00:17:20,373
Are you okay, Piyoko?

258
00:17:21,207 --> 00:17:23,292
I-I just got surprised.

259
00:17:23,417 --> 00:17:24,919
It's not too late to turn back.

260
00:17:26,212 --> 00:17:27,672
I'm going in!

261
00:17:28,214 --> 00:17:31,801
I've already decided!

262
00:17:32,593 --> 00:17:34,845
Good luck, lil' chick!

263
00:17:39,475 --> 00:17:41,602
<i>I'm gonna help the Mister!</i>

264
00:17:41,894 --> 00:17:44,438
<i>I can do this if I give it my all!</i>

265
00:17:44,689 --> 00:17:46,524
Just you wait, Morio.

266
00:17:46,649 --> 00:17:48,901
I'll save you, no matter what!

267
00:17:49,402 --> 00:17:51,696
<i>We're counting on you, Piyoko!</i>

268
00:17:52,655 --> 00:17:55,575
<i>The brain must be up here.</i>

269
00:17:55,741 --> 00:18:00,913
Ugh! It's sticky and gross!

270
00:18:01,372 --> 00:18:02,206
Huh?!

271
00:18:02,873 --> 00:18:06,043
It's coming from that thing
that looks like a butthole.

272
00:18:06,294 --> 00:18:08,337
I think I can use that to get there!

273
00:18:10,881 --> 00:18:13,551
It's sticky...

274
00:18:13,759 --> 00:18:16,429
It's so cramped in here.

275
00:18:17,096 --> 00:18:19,890
It's so dark, I can't see anything!

276
00:18:20,558 --> 00:18:22,977
It's still sticky too!

277
00:18:23,352 --> 00:18:25,980
Ugh! It stinks too!

278
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:32,612
Need to spit!

279
00:18:33,070 --> 00:18:34,196
Huh?!

280
00:18:34,989 --> 00:18:36,949
What could that be?

281
00:18:37,533 --> 00:18:39,660
I'm gonna follow the light.

282
00:18:42,246 --> 00:18:44,123
It's getting narrow.

283
00:18:45,875 --> 00:18:47,501
Oh, an exit!

284
00:18:49,587 --> 00:18:52,089
Yay! I got out!

285
00:18:59,555 --> 00:19:03,976
N-No way! I can't fight
that monster and win!

286
00:19:04,352 --> 00:19:07,938
<i>I'll hold this dam up,
even if it costs me my life!</i>

287
00:19:09,398 --> 00:19:11,442
Th-That's right!

288
00:19:11,567 --> 00:19:14,862
I can't abandon someone so kind!

289
00:19:14,987 --> 00:19:17,114
It's okay! I can win!

290
00:19:17,239 --> 00:19:18,824
I gotta believe in myself!

291
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:20,743
I can...

292
00:19:21,494 --> 00:19:22,662
DUTY

293
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:26,082
Do this!

294
00:19:40,012 --> 00:19:41,639
I...

295
00:19:42,098 --> 00:19:44,725
I won't lose!

296
00:19:54,610 --> 00:19:58,280
It hurts! It really hurts!

297
00:19:58,406 --> 00:20:03,077
I can't do this! I want to run away!

298
00:20:03,994 --> 00:20:04,870
Huh?

299
00:20:05,496 --> 00:20:07,123
This is...

300
00:20:08,040 --> 00:20:10,584
<i>This is Mister's feather...</i>

301
00:20:11,919 --> 00:20:14,505
<i>This will be my good luck charm!</i>

302
00:20:15,840 --> 00:20:17,049
That's right...

303
00:20:18,300 --> 00:20:21,220
No matter how hard and painful
it is...

304
00:20:21,345 --> 00:20:23,848
He never gives up!

305
00:20:26,851 --> 00:20:29,562
The Mister's on my side.

306
00:20:30,396 --> 00:20:32,064
I can't run away now.

307
00:20:32,314 --> 00:20:34,942
I am not gonna give up!

308
00:20:35,192 --> 00:20:39,488
DUTY

309
00:20:35,651 --> 00:20:39,447
<i>Think!
There's gotta be a way to win.</i>

310
00:20:39,572 --> 00:20:40,740
<i>Think!</i>

311
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,034
Wait a minute.

312
00:20:42,950 --> 00:20:44,410
DUTY

313
00:20:44,034 --> 00:20:47,121
Why hasn't it moved from that spot?

314
00:20:47,788 --> 00:20:51,125
This monster is...
connected to Morio's brain!

315
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:54,962
I get it!
It's not that it's not moving...

316
00:20:55,087 --> 00:20:56,630
It can't!

317
00:20:57,631 --> 00:21:01,343
I get it now.
Then this is the only way!

318
00:21:02,052 --> 00:21:04,472
I'll attack from behind!
DUTY

319
00:21:10,311 --> 00:21:13,773
Take that! And that, and that!

320
00:21:14,190 --> 00:21:16,358
I can win! I can win!

321
00:21:20,321 --> 00:21:23,240
Take that! And that, and that!

322
00:21:39,131 --> 00:21:41,008
Mi...

323
00:21:41,133 --> 00:21:43,511
Mister...

324
00:23:50,095 --> 00:23:53,432
You're all very brave.

325
00:23:54,016 --> 00:23:57,144
You've finally managed to drag those
Devils out into the open!

326
00:23:57,811 --> 00:24:00,064
Next Time:
To Back a Bird Into a Corner

327
00:24:00,105 --> 00:24:04,360
Nevertheless, dear Little Chick...
Are you actually all alone?

328
00:24:04,860 --> 00:24:09,782
FAN ART CONTEST AWARDS

